{
  "uid": "talkcal-slo",
  "title": "talkcal — SLO",
  "tags": [
    "talkcal",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "四個 SLO、28 天滾動視窗，目標與理由見 repo 的 `docs/slo.md`。數字都是 Mimir 錄製規則先算好的（`ops/mimir/rules/anonymous/slo.yaml`）。\n**看法**：error budget 剩多少 → 現在燒多快（burn rate，1 = 剛好 28 天燒完）→ 告警狀態。burn rate 圖上的虛線就是告警門檻。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "error budget 還剩幾成（28 天）",
      "description": "1 = 一點都沒用；0 = 剛好用完；負的 = 這 28 天已經不達標。28 天的資料還沒累積滿時，是用現有的資料算的。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:error_budget:remaining_ratio",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": -0.5,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "28 天達成率 vs 目標",
      "description": "SLI = 好的請求 / 全部請求。可用性：好 = 不是 5xx；延遲：好 = 比門檻快（一般 API 300ms、助理 8 秒）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "1 - slo:sli_error:ratio_rate28d",
          "legendFormat": "實際",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:objective:ratio",
          "legendFormat": "目標",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "slo": "SLO",
              "Value #A": "28 天實際",
              "Value #B": "目標"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "快燒：1 小時 burn rate",
      "description": "實線 1 小時、細線 5 分鐘。兩條都超過 13.44（虛線）就 page：照這速度 2 天燒光 28 天的 budget。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:burn_rate:1h",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}} 1h"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:burn_rate:5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}} 5m"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            },
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 13.44
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* 5m$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    4,
                    4
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "慢燒：1 天 burn rate",
      "description": "實線 1 天、細線 2 小時。兩條都超過 2.8（虛線）開 ticket：照這速度 10 天燒光。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:burn_rate:1d",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}} 1d"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "slo:burn_rate:2h",
          "legendFormat": "{{slo}} 2h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            },
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".* 2h$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    4,
                    4
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "SLI（1 小時視窗）",
      "description": "好的請求占幾成。掉到目標（各 SLO 不同，見右上表）以下的時間越久，budget 燒越多。",
      "gridPos": {
